410-14M.YAG, 4-ele., 14' boom, medium-duty elements
28.000 28.400 28.800 MHz
4 elements, inches
           2.310    0.625    0.500 
  0.000    2.000   34.000   70.000 
 36.000    2.000   34.000   63.875 
 72.000    2.000   34.000   62.250 
162.000    2.000   34.000   53.125 

NOTE: the lengths of the 0.625" o.d. sections have
been reduced by the lengths of the 2.310" o.d.
sections to simulate mounting plates, which are 
4" x 4" x 0.250" aluminum plates. These medium-duty
elements will withstand 96 mph winds.

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1, and a mid-band free-
space gain of 8.4 dBi.
